### PayNexus local smoke (gateway at :8080)

@base = http://localhost:8080
@keycloak = http://localhost:8088
@clientId = paynexus-cli
@username = demo@paynexus.local
@password = Demo123!

### Acquire a local-only token from Keycloak
# @name token
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/paynexus/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&username={{username}}&password={{password}}

### Profile
GET {{base}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### Wallet
GET {{base}}/api/v1/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### Create payment (repeat with the same Idempotency-Key to prove no double charge)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "amountMinor": 150000,
  "currency": "INR",
  "merchantId": "AMZN-IN",
  "country": "IN"
}

### Transactions
GET {{base}}/api/v1/transactions?status=COMPLETED&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### System status
GET {{base}}/api/v1/system/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### Admin review queue
GET {{base}}/api/v1/payments/admin/review-queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### Fraud policy RAG
POST {{base}}/api/v1/fraud/policies/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What fraud policy applies to international transactions above 2 lakh?"
}
